{
  "name": "BestClassicWB shared Workbench icons",
  "version": "2.1.12",
  "baseline": "2.1.12",
  "archives": {},
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS Workbench",
    "AmigaOS DefIcons for file type selection"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Owns shared BCWB artwork, including the volume, drawer, application and default icons. The icons preserve the complete serialized image and tooltype data.",
    "The AmigaOS executables, WBStartup commodities and existing third-party packages keep their own payloads. The standard RAM volume icon is linked to ENVARC:Sys/def_RAM.info during startup.",
    "Default project icons are shared Workbench entries. Their tool paths can reference independently catalogued programs."
  ],
